#### ❌ HIGH — Smell 2: Mystery Guest

**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 139)
**Research ref:** Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020 — "Mystery Guest"

```csharp
// ❌ Hard-coded absolute path to an external file that won't exist in CI
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```

**Risk:** Instant failure on any machine except the author's workstation. Also couples the test to opaque file contents nobody can inspect in the test.

